    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d339-a3">

                <pb facs="0645" n="1299" xml:id="pg1299"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 7.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Safvet Pasha to Mr.
                            Maynard.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">circular</hi> 3, <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">interdicting the imports of arms and munitions of
                        war</hi>.</p>
                <p>You are aware of the ordinances prohibiting the introduction of arms, munitions
                    of war, and revolvers into the Ottoman Empire.</p>
                <p>Some time, now, certain foreign merchants introduce into Turkey these forbidden
                    articles, which are notwithstanding confiscated by the state.</p>
                <p>In order to prevent any misunderstanding, and for the interest of commerce, I
                    think it proper to request you to give such orders, that the American merchants
                    shall observe strictly the regulations above indicated.</p>
                <closer><signed>SAFVET.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
